# --- Credential stores: never committed, in any location --------------------
# Narrow on purpose: the roadmap forbids secrets in the repo, but P0 evidence
# (receipts, audits, fixtures) must stay trackable. Do not broaden to *.json.
accounts.local.json
**/accounts.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

